   :section/body
   ["Would they like a coffee? = ¿Les gustaría un café?"
    "would like sirve para I, you, he, she, we y they sin cambiar."
    "Para preguntar: Would they like...?"
    "Para negar: They wouldn't like... / They would not like..."]}],
